      "position": [320, 240],
      "disabled": true,
      "notes": "Steps 2-3: Ephemeral memory (window = 3). DISABLED and not connected because Step 4 replaces it. To run Steps 2-3, remove the Postgres Chat Memory connection, connect this node to the AI Agent memory slot and enable it."
